  "reviews": [
    {
      "author": "Enes",
      "content": "You're spending so much budget and effort, why don't you make a proper horror movie? What kind of horror movie is just dialogue? And whoever did the subtitle translation for this movie, they shouldn't do it anymore. I'm going blind! The subtitles end before the character finishes speaking. The acting is passable, the effects are bad, and the script seems to have been written with the mentality of \"the faster I finish it, the better.\" Is it watchable? I don't think so. If you like demons, horror, and goat themes, then give it a try.",
      "rating": 3,
      "createdAt": "2026-02-12T08:16:13Z"
    }
